<title>ITALY: Italian Dec LIFFE Btp future sets new record high.</title>
<headline>Italian Dec LIFFE Btp future sets new record high.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1996-12-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The December futures contract on LIFFE on fixed rate Italian government bonds (BTPs) set a record high at 129.40 in early trade, topping the previous record of 129.25 set on November 29.</p>
<p>The contract, which expires on Wednesday, was trading 30 basis points up at 129.36 by 0810 GMT.</p>
<p>--Milan bureau +392 66129507</p>
</text>
